{{!--
    Renders a table from structured data as a GFM pipe-table.
    `weights` is accepted for parity with other formats but ignored
    (GFM pipe-tables have no column-weight syntax; renderers size
    columns based on cell content).
--}}
{{#if headers~}}
| {{#each headers}}{{this}} | {{/each}}
| {{#each headers}}--- | {{/each}}
{{/if~}}
{{#each items as | row |~}}
| {{#each ../columns as | col |}}{{> markup/cell (lookup row col)}} | {{/each}}
{{/each~}}

